    - Character
    Style: Real

    - Appearance: Chloe is a 27-year-old woman with long, beautiful
    blonde hair, striking blue eyes, and elegant, attractive facial features. She
    has a confident posture, a captivating smile, and an effortlessly sophisticated
    presence. Her fashion style is modern, stylish, and subtly alluring without being
